Update the existing MCP Auth connector configuration

Usage:
  mcp-runtime cluster mcp-auth-connector apply [flags]

Flags:
      --connector string    Connector name used by the MCP Auth deployment
      --context string      Explicit Kubernetes context
      --dry-run             Show whether the connector ConfigMap would change
      --file string         Connector JSON file without credentials
  -h, --help                help for apply
      --kubeconfig string   Explicit kubeconfig path
      --yes                 Apply the change without an interactive prompt

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
